5 text-blue-400">changed</span><span class="min-w-0"><span class="text-foreground font-mono text-xs font-medium">checkout</span><span class="text-ink-subtle ml-2 text-xs leading-relaxed">now rounds before display</span></span></li><li class="flex items-baseline gap-2.5"><span data-change="added" class="inline-flex h-[18px] w-[72px] shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded border text-[10px] font-medium tracking-[0.03em] border-emerald-500/35 text-emerald-400">added</span><span class="min-w-0"><span class="text-foreground font-mono text-xs font-medium">invoicing</span><span class="text-ink-subtle ml-2 text-xs leading-relaxed">rounds on its own, already</span></span></li><li class="flex items-baseline gap-2.5"><span data-change="removed" class="inline-flex h-[18px] w-[72px] shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded border text-[10px] font-medium tracking-[0.03em] border-destructive/40 text-destructive">removed</span><span class="min-w-0"><span class="text-foreground font-mono text-xs font-medium">legacy-quotes</span><span class="text-ink-subtle ml-2 text-xs leading-relaxed">the old rounding helper is gone</span></span></li><li class="flex items-baseline gap-2.5"><span data-change="read-only" class="inline-flex h-[18px] w-[72px] shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded border text-[10px] font-medium tracking-[0.03em] border-border text-ink-tertiary">untouched</span><span class="min-w-0"><span class="text-foreground font-mono text-xs font-medium">billing</span><span class="text-ink-subtle ml-2 text-xs leading-relaxed">consumes pricing output unchanged</span></span></li></ul></div></section>"`;

