er px-1.5 py-[1px] font-mono text-[10px]">reporting</span><span class="border-border text-ink-subtle rounded border px-1.5 py-[1px] font-mono text-[10px]">the customer-facing quote PDF</span></span></td><td class="px-2 py-2 align-top"><span data-likelihood="medium" class="inline-flex rounded border px-1.5 py-[1px] text-[10px] font-medium border-amber-500/40 text-amber-400">medium</span></td></tr><tr class="border-border/40 border-b last:border-b-0"><td class="text-foreground px-2 py-2 align-top font-mono text-[11px]">quoteFor() return type</td><td class="text-foreground/85 px-2 py-2 align-top leading-relaxed">Any caller that assumed a rounded value is now off by cents.</td><td class="px-2 py-2 align-top"><span class="text-ink-tertiary">—</span></td><td class="px-2 py-2 align-top"><span data-likelihood="high" class="inline-flex rounded border px-1.5 py-[1px] text-[10px] font-medium border-destructive/40 text-destructive">high</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section>"`;

